        "created_at": "2015-05-26T12:31:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Nielzabub\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/48/1986_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Nielzabub:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Probably the best use I've seen of RC Wraith is playing A Close Quarters Combat during the first turn of the hero phase. Free power boost with no penalties.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Unless one of Voss's warships is out.</p>",
