      {
        "id": 40657,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-08-25T21:07:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Small addition -- like Absolute Zero, Wraith loves Twist the Ether, because it means all of her attacks -- including Combat Stance and Throat Jab -- can be projectile and get the bonus from her targetting computer, which makes it a lot easier for the latter to get through big damage reduction (like, say, Spite with his drugs out).</p>",
