      {
        "id": 40660,
        "name": "Animus",
        "username": "Animus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/animus/{size}/1887_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-08-27T12:22:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Small addition – like Absolute Zero, Wraith loves Twist the Ether, because it means all of her attacks – including Combat Stance and Throat Jab – can be projectile and get the bonus from her targetting computer, which makes it a lot easier for the latter to get through big damage reduction (like, say, Spite with his drugs out).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yet another reason why I love The Visionary. The sad thing is that my favorite non-canon team includes Visionary and Wraith and I didn't see this.</p>\n<p>I love this game.&nbsp;</p>",
