        "created_at": "2015-08-28T18:23:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Animus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/animus/48/1887_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Animus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>mwc146 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Small addition -- like Absolute Zero, Wraith loves Twist the Ether, because it means all of her attacks -- including Combat Stance and Throat Jab -- can be projectile and get the bonus from her targetting computer, which makes it a lot easier for the latter to get through big damage reduction (like, say, Spite with his drugs out).\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nYet another reason why I love The Visionary. The sad thing is that my favorite non-canon team includes Visionary and Wraith and I didn't see this.I love this game.&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Agreed. That's so nice and been out there for so long and I don't recall ever using ToE quite that way.</p>",
